WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:08.737
Once there was a girl named Rapunzel.

2
00:00:08.738 --> 00:00:12.341
Her family lived on a small farm.

3
00:00:12.342 --> 00:00:15.608
Rapunzel loved to work in the garden.

4
00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:18.883
She also loved to sing.

5
00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:23.710
"Plant the seeds just so," Rapunzel sang.

6
00:00:23.711 --> 00:00:28.078
"Watch the green beans grow!

7
00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:32.870
Plant the seeds just so.

8
00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:38.283
Watch the green beans grow!"

9
00:00:38.284 --> 00:00:42.478
On this day Rapunzel turned ten.

10
00:00:42.479 --> 00:00:46.027
Her birthday was usually a happy day.

11
00:00:46.028 --> 00:00:51.549
But today Mama and Papa were acting strange.

12
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:56.967
"Why is Papa looking at the road?" Rapunzel thought.

13
00:00:56.968 --> 00:01:00.330
"Someone is coming!" Papa cried.

14
00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:02.927
"Rapunzel! Hide!"

15
00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:08.197
"What? Why?" Rapunzel was confused.

16
00:01:08.198 --> 00:01:15.741
"Quick, Rapunzel! Now!" Mama said.

17
00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:19.356
Rapunzel crawled under a bush.

18
00:01:19.357 --> 00:01:22.891
"Why do I have to hide?" she thought.

19
00:01:22.892 --> 00:01:25.519
"This is so strange!"

20
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:29.772
Suddenly a bird flew into the bush.

21
00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:37.259
Rapunzel smiled. "Would you like some seeds, bird?"

22
00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:41.326
The bird hopped onto Rapunzel's hand.

23
00:01:41.327 --> 00:01:45.126
It ate the seeds.

24
00:01:45.127 --> 00:01:51.638
Mama was peering over the fence.

25
00:01:51.639 --> 00:01:56.431
"Whew!" she said. "It was just a farmer.

26
00:01:56.432 --> 00:02:00.391
He is going to the market."

27
00:02:00.392 --> 00:02:02.695
Rapunzel popped up.

28
00:02:02.696 --> 00:02:05.323
"I wish we could go to the market.

29
00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:09.355
It would be fun to go to the city."

30
00:02:09.356 --> 00:02:14.630
Papa shook his head. "The city is not safe."

31
00:02:14.631 --> 00:02:19.340
Rapunzel frowned. "We never go anywhere.

32
00:02:19.341 --> 00:02:22.886
We never meet anyone new."

33
00:02:22.887 --> 00:02:27.688
Rapunzel looked from her father to her mother.

34
00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:31.529
"What are you scared of?"

35
00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:34.498
Papa did not answer.

36
00:02:34.499 --> 00:02:39.904
Mama bit her lip. "She is ten years old today.

37
00:02:39.905 --> 00:02:43.546
We must tell her."

38
00:02:43.547 --> 00:02:47.415
"Tell me what?" Rapunzel asked.

39
00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:54.537
Papa sighed. "Come with me."

40
00:02:54.538 --> 00:02:59.426
Papa led Rapunzel to a small hill.

41
00:02:59.427 --> 00:03:03.411
He bent down and grabbed a rock.

42
00:03:03.412 --> 00:03:05.655
Rapunzel gasped.

43
00:03:05.656 --> 00:03:09.978
"That's not a rock—it's a door handle!"

44
00:03:09.979 --> 00:03:12.784
Papa opened the door.

45
00:03:12.785 --> 00:03:17.238
Inside was a small room.

46
00:03:17.239 --> 00:03:20.654
"I built this for you, Rapunzel," Papa said.

47
00:03:20.655 --> 00:03:27.170
"You must hide here when the witch comes!"

